# ── running it on your own machine ──────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your own key in. The game runs
# fully without one; only the grown-ups' written summary needs it.
VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# ── deploying it ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On a deployed site the key must NOT be a VITE_ variable: Vite inlines
# those into the JavaScript it ships, where anyone can read them. Set
# these two in the host's environment settings instead, where they stay
# on the server. Without both, the summary feature switches itself off.
#
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY   your key
#   REPORT_PASSWORD    what a visitor has to type to use the summary
